      zone zdown-63-soft-1 asset mark-tree-down-60-soft-1 keys C#4 F4 velocity 0 0.65 root D#4
      zone zdown-68-soft-1 asset mark-tree-down-60-soft-1 keys F#4 A#4 velocity 0 0.65 root G#4
